<title>POLAND: Dom Plast Q3 net doubles to PLN 2.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Dom Plast Q3 net doubles to PLN 2.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dom Plast SA results for the third quarter ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						  Q3 1996	Q3 1995</p>
<p>    profit before extraordinary items    4.87   vs    2.26</p>
<p>    pre-tax					4.87   vs    2.26</p>
<p>    net					    2.63   vs    1.29</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Dom Plast SA. @</p>
<p>    net sales				   20.63   vs   20.58</p>
<p>    costs of sales			    12.81   vs   15.70</p>
